<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007), Cartwright et al. (2009) & BCF (1951) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target loops, chitin pore mineral-bridge columnar vs sheet transition, 3D cholesteric chitin precursor coupling and brick-and-mortar tablet-sliding fracture — Model fidelity to source: 89/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The Pass 2 solvers are unchanged and still match Cartwright & Checa (2007) / BCF (1951) as formulated: Gibbs-Thomson step velocity, multi-dislocation eikonal step flow, Frank-Read dipole clearance, mineral-bridge columnar vs sheet stacking and Voronoi coalescence. Pass 3 adds a correct de Gennes cholesteric construction (n = (cos phi, sin phi, 0), phi = (pi/h_0)(z - u), half-pitch = h_0, n = -n so S = cos 2 phi) in which the BCF phase enters as the layer displacement u, so membranes are helicoids and the Burgers vector equals the net screw charge (+5 vs a template-free v2), and a tension-shear-chain / Schmid-slip / waviness-hardening / Griffith-cap fracture model that reproduces the Jackson, Wang and Gao orders of magnitude (+4). Deductions: the cholesteric coupling is kinematic — no Frank free-energy, no pitch selection, no director dynamics — so it is a template imposed by the BCF phase rather than the self-assembly Cartwright et al. (2009) describe, and the function's own docstring says so (-5); the terrace pitch returned to the ledger is 0.15 raw + 0.85 analytic, so the solver's pitch is never actually tested against theory (-3); the Law 3 stacking margin is a hard-coded literal (42 - 80*2, 78 - 36*1) rather than computed from the simulated fields (-3); tablets are elastic-brittle with no intra-tablet crystal plasticity and sigma_f = Phi sigma_crit / 2 hits 170 MPa by the flaw = h/2 convention (-3); `pitch_tower`, `tower_spacing`, `spacing` constants are unsourced (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L435–L451: _measure_radial_terrace_pitch returns 0.15 * raw_pitch + 0.85 * theo_pitch — the reported 'measured' pitch is 85 % the analytic value <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L435-L451>",
        "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L521–L529: Docstring states the coupling is a kinematic liquid-crystal template, NOT a Frank free-energy minimisation; q / period / Burgers are consistency checks of the construction <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L521-L529>",
        "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L719–L735: stacking_margin = 42 - 80 * 2 and 78 - 36 * 1 are literals, not computed from the simulated mineral-bridge / terrace fields <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L719-L735>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007), Cartwright et al. (2009) & BCF (1951) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target loops, chitin pore mineral-bridge columnar vs sheet transition, 3D cholesteric chitin precursor coupling and brick-and-mortar tablet-sliding fracture — Morphometric validation: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` now returns 16 reference-anchored measurements (9 Pass 2 + 7 Pass 3) and the Pass 3 ones are honest where it matters: E = 89.5 vs Jackson 73 GPa (23 % high), Gamma = 608 J/m^2 inside Jackson's 350-1240 but x608 against Currey's ~3000x, sigma_f = 169.5 vs 170, eps_p,f = 0.82 % vs Wang ~1 %, h* = 28.3 vs Gao ~30 nm, twist rate 6.224 vs 6.283 rad/um, period 0.5007 vs 0.5000 um — misses are reported, not hidden (+4). Deductions: the two headline Pass 2 correlations (supersaturation r = 1.0000, 12-species r = 0.9999) are against `lambda_obs` tables generated from the same BCF law (no digitised figure points), so they validate nothing empirical and should not have been credited in v2 (-6); the Pteria terrace wavelength 7.94 vs 7.97 um is 85 % analytic by construction of L451 (-3); two Pass 3 measurements use model predictions as references — dv_z/dP vs omega / 4 pi is an algebraic identity (r = 1 trivially) and rho* vs dataset D_tab / h_0 compares a derived threshold with an SEM aspect ratio (-3); the twist-rate and period checks are discretisation checks of an analytic field whose 2 % tolerance is tuned to n_z = 120 (-2); the SEM Z / aspect references are self-referential (-2, remainder scored under specimen-match); the quick gate's 100/100 therefore overstates the validation depth." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals_reference.json L80–L95: supersaturation rows: lambda_obs_um tracks lambda_pred_um to within 0.03 um at every level — synthetic, no digitised source figure cited <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/datasets/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals/nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals_reference.json#L80-L95>",
        "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L2050–L2060: dv_z/dP measurement with reference omega / 4 pi: an analytic identity of the construction, not an empirical anchor <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L2050-L2060>",
        "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L790–L879: evaluate_supersaturation_and_cross_taxa_scaling consumes supersaturation_wavelength_scaling and cross_taxa_nacre_terrace_scaling tables whose lambda_obs values were generated from the BCF law (r = 0.9999 is circular) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L790-L879>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-12-species-cross-taxa-bcf-spiral-terrace-wavelength-correlation-bivalvia-sheet-vs-gastropoda-cephalopoda-columnar-nacre>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-12-species-spiral-angular-rotation-frequency-correlation-omega-omega-0-v-inf-r-c>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-3d-cholesteric-chitin-precursor-twist-rate-q-n-curl-n-recovered-from-the-bcf-coupled-director-volume>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-3d-cholesteric-membrane-period-p-2-recovered-from-the-z-power-spectrum-of-the-lamellar-density-vs-sem-segmented-h-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-bivalve-sheet-nacre-pteria-hirundo-single-spiral-terrace-wavelength-lambda-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-brick-and-mortar-tablet-pull-out-work-of-fracture-gamma-tau-p-l-ov-2-h>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-brick-and-mortar-tensile-strength-at-griffith-tablet-fracture-after-waviness-hardened-interlamellar-sliding>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-brick-and-mortar-tension-shear-chain-effective-tensile-modulus-e-ji-gao-2004-at-sem-h-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-coalesced-aragonite-tablet-voronoi-polygonal-coordination-number-z-haliotis-mineral-bridge-lattice>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-coupled-vertical-nacre-growth-rate-sensitivity-to-cholesteric-pitch-d-v-z-d-p-omega-4-pi>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-interlamellar-slip-system-ductile-to-brittle-critical-aspect-ratio-rho-sigma-tab-crit-tau-p>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-sem-specimen-aragonite-tablet-hexagonal-coordination-number-z-haliotis-nacre-spirals-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-sem-specimen-aragonite-tablet-width-to-thickness-aspect-ratio-d-tab-h-0-haliotis-nacre-spirals-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-sem-specimen-segmented-inter-lamellar-aragonite-tablet-thickness-h-0-haliotis-nacre-spirals-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-subcritical-frank-read-dipole-sub-saturated-negative-control-active-terraces-d-0-60-um-2-r-c-0-84-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-measurement-supersaturation-spiral-terrace-wavelength-scaling-correlation-lambda-0-delta-mu-19-gamma-omega-delta-mu>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-morphometric-validation-2> ;
