    pk:evidenceAgainst "models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py L2008–L2029: SEM Z reference_value 5.96 (L2015) and aspect reference_value 3.2436 (L2025) are the script's own earlier outputs, not independent literature values <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L2008-L2029>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-specimen-match-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-specimen-match-2>,
