<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Burton-Cabrera-Frank (1951) Gibbs-Thomson Step Velocity & Supersaturation Terrace Spacing Scaling Law" ;
    dct:description "Arrests curved step propagation at r = r_c and scales spiral terrace wavelength λ_0 ≈ 19 r_c inversely with supersaturation Δμ across molluscan nacre | Variables: v(κ): normal step velocity; v_∞: planar step speed; r_c = γ Ω / Δμ: critical nucleation radius; Δμ: chemical supersaturation; λ_0: Archimedean spiral terrace wavelength" ;
    dct:source "Burton, Cabrera & Frank (1951) Phil. Trans. R. Soc. A 243:299-358; Cartwright & Checa (2007) J. R. Soc. Interface 4:491-504 Sec. 2-3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L197-L268>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_078_nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals.lean#L24-L53> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gibbs_thomson_step_velocity_num (v_inf r r_c : Int) : Int :=
  v_inf * (r - r_c)
def bcf_terrace_wavelength (r_c : Int) : Int := 19 * r_c
theorem bcf_gibbs_thompson_terrace_spacing (v_inf r_c r_c2 : Int) (dr_c : Nat) :
    gibbs_thomson_step_velocity_num v_inf r_c r_c = 0 ∧
    bcf_terrace_wavelength r_c2 < bcf_terrace_wavelength (r_c2 + Int.ofNat (dr_c + 1)) := by
  dsimp [gibbs_thomson_step_velocity_num, bcf_terrace_wavelength]; omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "v(κ) = v_∞ (1 - r_c κ),  r_c = γ Ω / Δμ  ⇒  λ_0 = 19 r_c = 19 γ Ω / Δμ  (strictly decreasing with Δμ_2 > Δμ_1 > 0)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/b97416>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0006-3495(00)76426-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2004.03.006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2006.07.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0631609100>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0900867106>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsif.2006.0188>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1977.0050>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1988.0056>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.1951.0006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.2011.0600>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1557/JMR.2001.0340> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Burton-Cabrera-Frank (BCF) Screw-Dislocation Aragonite Nacre Terraces, Frank-Read Target Loops & Chitin Mineral-Bridge Columnar vs Sheet Transition" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.bcf_terrace_wavelength" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.bcf_gibbs_thompson_terrace_spacing" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright et al. (2009) Opposite-Handedness (+1, -1) Frank-Read Dipole Annihilation & Closed Target-Loop Law" ;
    dct:description "Governs topological recombination of counter-rotating spiral arms into closed concentric target loops when d > 2 r_c and subcritical pinch-off failure when d < 2 r_c | Variables: b_1 = +1, b_2 = -1: opposite-handedness screw dislocation Burgers vectors; B_tot: far-field topological Burgers charge; d: inter-core dipole separation; 2 r_c: critical nucleation diameter" ;
    dct:source "Cartwright, Checa, Escribano & Sainz-Díaz (2009) PNAS 106(26):10499-10504 Figs. 1-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L273-L474>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_078_nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals.lean#L59-L83> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def total_burgers_charge (b_1 b_2 : Int) : Int := b_1 + b_2
def frank_read_dipole_clearance (d r_c : Int) : Int := d - 2 * r_c
theorem frank_read_dipole_target_loop_nucleation (b r_c : Int) (dd : Nat) :
    total_burgers_charge 1 (-1) = 0 ∧
    frank_read_dipole_clearance (2 * r_c + Int.ofNat (dd + 1)) r_c > 0 ∧
    frank_read_dipole_clearance (2 * r_c - Int.ofNat (dd + 1)) r_c < 0 := by
  dsimp [total_burgers_charge, frank_read_dipole_clearance]; omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "B_tot = (+1) + (-1) = 0;  d > 2 r_c ⇒ closed concentric target terraces;  d ≤ 2 r_c ⇒ pinch-off failure" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/b97416>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0006-3495(00)76426-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2004.03.006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2006.07.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0631609100>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0900867106>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsif.2006.0188>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1977.0050>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1988.0056>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.1951.0006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.2011.0600>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1557/JMR.2001.0340> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Burton-Cabrera-Frank (BCF) Screw-Dislocation Aragonite Nacre Terraces, Frank-Read Target Loops & Chitin Mineral-Bridge Columnar vs Sheet Transition" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.frank_read_dipole_clearance" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.frank_read_dipole_target_loop_nucleation" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007) Chitin Interlamellar Pore Mineral-Bridge Columnar vs Sheet Nacre Transition Law" ;
    dct:description "Separates gastropod (Haliotis rufescens) coaxial columnar tablet stacks nucleated through aligned vertical chitin mineral bridges from bivalve (Pteria, Pinctada) terraced sheet nacre | Variables: D_tab: aragonite tablet diameter before coalescence; λ_0: spiral terrace wavelength; N_off: off-axis interlamellar chitin pore dispersion factor" ;
    dct:source "Cartwright & Checa (2007) J. R. Soc. Interface 4:491-504 Sec. 4 & Figs. 7-9" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L655-L748>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_078_nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals.lean#L89-L115> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def nacre_columnar_stacking_margin (d_tab lam_0 n_off : Int) : Int :=
  d_tab - lam_0 * n_off
theorem cartwright_columnar_vs_sheet_nacre_transition (d_tab lam_0 : Int) :
    nacre_columnar_stacking_margin 78 36 1 = 42 ∧
    nacre_columnar_stacking_margin 42 80 2 = -118 := by
  dsimp [nacre_columnar_stacking_margin]; omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "I_col = D_tab - λ_0 N_off:  I_col > 0 (aligned vertical mineral bridges, tight λ_0) ⇒ Haliotis columnar stacks;  I_col < 0 (dispersed pores, broad λ_0) ⇒ bivalve sheet nacre" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/b97416>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0006-3495(00)76426-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2004.03.006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2006.07.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0631609100>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0900867106>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsif.2006.0188>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1977.0050>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1988.0056>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.1951.0006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.2011.0600>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1557/JMR.2001.0340> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Burton-Cabrera-Frank (BCF) Screw-Dislocation Aragonite Nacre Terraces, Frank-Read Target Loops & Chitin Mineral-Bridge Columnar vs Sheet Transition" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.nacre_columnar_stacking_margin" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.cartwright_columnar_vs_sheet_nacre_transition" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright et al. (2009) Cholesteric Chitin-Fibroin Precursor Half-Pitch ⇄ BCF Screw-Dislocation Membrane Coupling Law (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Couples the 2D BCF spiral/target step-flow phase field to a 3D cholesteric liquid-crystal membrane stack whose helicoidal defects carry the Burgers vector m h_0 and whose half-pitch sets the vertical growth rate | Variables: n: cholesteric director; φ: twist angle; P: cholesteric pitch; h_0 = P/2: membrane period (SEM-anchored 0.50 µm); u: helicoidal layer displacement driven by the 2D BCF phase Φ_2D; q: twist rate; m: Burgers charge; v_z: vertical nacre growth rate" ;
    dct:source "Cartwright, Checa, Escribano & Sainz-Díaz (2009) PNAS 106(26):10499-10504; de Gennes & Prost (1993) The Physics of Liquid Crystals Ch. 6; Kleman & Lavrentovich (2003) Soft Matter Physics Ch. 8" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L480-L650>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_078_nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals.lean#L118-L156> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def cholesteric_pitch (h_0 : Int) : Int := 2 * h_0
def helicoid_burgers_vector (m h_0 : Int) : Int := m * h_0
def vertical_growth_twice_pi_scaled (m h_0 : Int) : Int := m * h_0 * 985
theorem cholesteric_half_pitch_screw_dislocation_coupling (h_0 : Int) (dh : Nat) :
    cholesteric_pitch 50 = 100 ∧
    helicoid_burgers_vector 1 h_0 + helicoid_burgers_vector (-1) h_0 = 0 ∧
    helicoid_burgers_vector 2 h_0 = cholesteric_pitch h_0 ∧
    vertical_growth_twice_pi_scaled 1 h_0 < vertical_growth_twice_pi_scaled 1 (h_0 + Int.ofNat (dh + 1)) := by
  dsimp [cholesteric_pitch, helicoid_burgers_vector, vertical_growth_twice_pi_scaled]; omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "n = (cos φ, sin φ, 0),  φ = (π/h_0)(z − u),  u = h_0 Φ_2D / 2π,  P = 2 h_0,  q = −n·∇×n = π/h_0,  b_vec = ∮du = m h_0,  v_z = m h_0 ω / 2π" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/b97416>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0006-3495(00)76426-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2004.03.006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2006.07.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0631609100>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0900867106>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsif.2006.0188>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1977.0050>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1988.0056>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.1951.0006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.2011.0600>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1557/JMR.2001.0340> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Burton-Cabrera-Frank (BCF) Screw-Dislocation Aragonite Nacre Terraces, Frank-Read Target Loops & Chitin Mineral-Bridge Columnar vs Sheet Transition" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.cholesteric_pitch" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.cholesteric_half_pitch_screw_dislocation_coupling" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Brick-and-Mortar Tension-Shear-Chain Tablet-Sliding Fracture Toughness Law (Jackson 1988 · Gao 2003 · Ji & Gao 2004 · Barthelat 2007) (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Rate-independent single-slip-system plasticity of the brick-and-mortar RVE: elastic TSC branch, Schmid-law interlamellar sliding with waviness hardening, Griffith tablet fracture, and tablet pull-out toughening (×608 vs aragonite, inside the Jackson 1988 350-1240 J/m² range) | Variables: Φ: mineral volume fraction; ρ = L/h: tablet aspect ratio; τ_p: interlamellar interface shear strength; ψ: tablet waviness angle; t_m: mortar thickness; σ_tab,crit: Griffith tablet strength; L_ov = L/2: overlap; Γ: work of fracture; Γ_m: aragonite fracture energy; h*: flaw-tolerant thickness" ;
    dct:source "Jackson, Vincent & Turner (1988) Proc. R. Soc. B 234:415-440; Currey (1977) Proc. R. Soc. B 196:443-463; Gao et al. (2003) PNAS 100:5597-5600; Ji & Gao (2004) JMPS 52:1963-1990; Barthelat et al. (2007) JMPS 55:306-337; Wang et al. (2001) J. Mater. Res. 16:2485-2493" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/2019-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals.py#L981-L1223>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_078_nacre_screw_dislocation_spirals.lean#L159-L201> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def tsc_yield_strength_x2000 (tau : Int) : Int := 95 * 156 * tau
def tablet_fracture_cap_x2000 : Int := 95 * 3568
def pullout_work_x50 (tau : Int) : Int := 1521 * tau
theorem tsc_tablet_sliding_fracture_toughness (tau : Int) (dt : Nat) :
    tsc_yield_strength_x2000 20 < tablet_fracture_cap_x2000 ∧
    (tsc_yield_strength_x2000 tau < tablet_fracture_cap_x2000 ↔ tau ≤ 22) ∧
    pullout_work_x50 tau < pullout_work_x50 (tau + Int.ofNat (dt + 1)) ∧
    17500 ≤ pullout_work_x50 20 ∧ pullout_work_x50 20 ≤ 62000 := by
  dsimp [tsc_yield_strength_x2000, tablet_fracture_cap_x2000, pullout_work_x50]; omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "1/E = 4(1−Φ)/(G_p Φ² ρ²) + 1/(Φ E_m);  σ_y = Φ ρ τ_p / 2;  τ(s) = τ_p + H s, H = E_n tan²ψ / t_m;  σ_f = Φ σ_tab,crit / 2, σ_tab,crit = √(E_m Γ_m / (π h/2));  Γ = τ_p L_ov² / h;  ρ* = σ_tab,crit / τ_p;  h* = π Γ_m E_m / σ_th²" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/b97416>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0006-3495(00)76426-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2004.03.006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2006.07.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0631609100>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0900867106>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsif.2006.0188>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1977.0050>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.1988.0056>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.1951.0006>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsta.2011.0600>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1557/JMR.2001.0340> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Burton-Cabrera-Frank (BCF) Screw-Dislocation Aragonite Nacre Terraces, Frank-Read Target Loops & Chitin Mineral-Bridge Columnar vs Sheet Transition" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.pullout_work_x50" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_078.tsc_tablet_sliding_fracture_toughness" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

